{
  "id": "blinksecwf07revr",
  "name": "[BlinkSec] WF-07 - Reversion programada - v1",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "wf07-cron",
      "name": "Cada 15 minutos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -600,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT id, alert_id, action_type, target, platform, undo_payload, expires_at\nFROM blinksec.containment_log\nWHERE reverted_at IS NULL\n  AND expires_at <= now()\n  AND undo_payload IS NOT NULL\n  AND action_type IN ('block_ip', 'isolate_host')\nORDER BY expires_at ASC\nLIMIT 50;",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wf07-query",
      "name": "Contenciones vencidas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        -380,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "blinksec-pg",
          "name": "BlinkSec Postgres"
        }
      },
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "notes": "Se excluyen revoke_session y kill_process: no son reversibles por naturaleza. LIMIT 50 evita que un backlog acumulado sature las APIs en una sola pasada."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c-hay",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "exists",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wf07-if-hay",
      "name": "¿Hay algo que revertir?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -160,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "=https://wazuh.example.com:55000{{ $json.undo_payload.path }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.undo_payload.body ?? {}) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "wf07-revert",
      "name": "Ejecutar reversión",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        60,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "blinksec-wazuh",
          "name": "Wazuh API"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// WF-07 · Registro del resultado de la reversión.\n//\n// Una reversión fallida es MÁS grave que una contención fallida: significa\n// que hay una regla de firewall activa que nadie va a quitar y que el sistema\n// cree haber gestionado. Se registra el error explícitamente para que aparezca\n// en el informe de guardia en lugar de desvanecerse.\n\nconst fila = $('Contenciones vencidas').first().json;\nconst respuesta = $input.first().json;\n\nconst ok = (respuesta.statusCode ?? 0) >= 200 && (respuesta.statusCode ?? 0) < 300;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      id: fila.id,\n      alert_id: fila.alert_id,\n      target: fila.target,\n      action_type: fila.action_type,\n      ok,\n      error: ok ? null : `HTTP ${respuesta.statusCode}: ${JSON.stringify(respuesta.body ?? {}).slice(0, 300)}`,\n    },\n  },\n];"
      },
      "id": "wf07-result",
      "name": "Evaluar resultado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        280,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "UPDATE blinksec.containment_log\nSET reverted_at = CASE WHEN $2::boolean THEN now() ELSE NULL END,\n    revert_error = $3\nWHERE id = $1;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [$json.id, $json.ok, $json.error] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "wf07-update",
      "name": "Actualizar registro",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        500,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "blinksec-pg",
          "name": "BlinkSec Postgres"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Si falla, reverted_at queda NULL y la fila se reintentará en la siguiente pasada. La reversión es idempotente: quitar una regla inexistente no rompe nada."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c-fallo",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "false",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wf07-if-fallo",
      "name": "¿Falló la reversión?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#soc-guardia",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=⚠️ Reversión fallida: `{{ $json.action_type }}` sobre `{{ $json.target }}` sigue activa tras vencer. Requiere intervención manual.\n\n`{{ $json.error }}`",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "wf07-alert",
      "name": "Avisar a guardia",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        940,
        140
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "blinksec-slack",
          "name": "BlinkSec Slack"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Cada 15 minutos": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Contenciones vencidas",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Contenciones vencidas": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "¿Hay algo que revertir?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "¿Hay algo que revertir?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Ejecutar reversión",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Ejecutar reversión": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Evaluar resultado",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Evaluar resultado": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Actualizar registro",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Actualizar registro": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "¿Falló la reversión?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "¿Falló la reversión?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Avisar a guardia",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "errorWorkflow": "blinksecwf99errs"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "blinksec": {
      "fase": 5,
      "descripcion": "Recorre containment_log y revierte las contenciones vencidas. Impide que el SOAR acumule reglas de firewall permanentes que nadie recuerda por qué existen."
    }
  }
}
